    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94130" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σικχ-ός</span></b> , ὁ, a <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>squeamish, fastidious person</i>,
